               <msContents>
                  <summary> II)
                     Taʾammǝra tazkāra motu la-ʾIyasus Krǝstos “Miracles concerning the Commemoration
                     of the Death of Jesus Christ”, 5 unnumbered miracles (fols. ) (cp.
                     GBI-013, II)&#xD; III) Malkǝʾa Mädḫane ʿAläm “Image of the Saviour of the
                     World” (fols.)&#xD; IV) ʾƎsaggǝd la-zǝkra sǝmǝkä… “I worship the
                     mention of your name…” (fols. 57va-61ra) (cp. ChRep 318, no. 339)&#xD; 
                     
                      
                     VII) Miracles of the Saviour of the World worked by ʾabuna Takla Māryām (fols.
                     64rb-65rb, )&#xD; 
                     VII-1) &#xD; VII-2)
                     VII-3) ; VIII) Gadla Takla Māryām
                     “Vita of Takla Māryām” (Mäbaʾa Ṣǝyon) (fols. 65rb-89va)&#xD; &#xD; &#xD;
                     Additiones 1-4.</summary>
                  <msItem xml:id="ms_i1">
